            "review_title": "Review at Gyukatsu Yosakura",
            "review_text": "Bảo Mint\n2 contributions\n0\nDelicious Unagi Rice with Authentic Japanese Flavor\nDec 2025 • Solo\nThe unagi rice set was delicious and well-prepared. The eel was tender, flavorful, and grilled perfectly with a rich yet balanced sauce. The rice was soft and fragrant, and the portion size was satisfying. The packaging was neat, and the food was still warm when it arrived. Overall, a great Japanese-style meal and definitely worth trying.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 27, 2025",
