            "review_title": "Review at Gyukatsu Yosakura",
            "review_text": "Kawano\nKawasaki, Japan6 contributions\n0\nIt is certain to make reservations in advance.\nMay 2025 • Couples\nVisiting with my partner. It was better than the beef cutlet I eat in Japan. I think the eel sheep eyelids are perfect compared to what you eat in Japan. There were a couple of couples and female customers, but the content seemed to please the boys. The staff were very accommodating, as was Nakai-san at an old Japanese restaurant. The staff saw me off with a smile on my way home. My heart was full. I'm going to go again.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten May 21, 2025",
